      "request_id": "00b558e230b6d4e4565f9483a02928a162549db97c482a64d7abbe5acd7b5af3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dfa4180b50aff268039201ebabfde487",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网和美网，安德烈耶娃都先赢下一盘，最后却都没赢下比赛。同一个赛季，她又拿了三座冠军。看懂她的第一次单打年终，要把这些比赛放在一起看。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d6241f29168907b36fe5e5734ee3a994cc6c76c46f70b81b6c909b9f0c1cc5c5",
      "words_sha256": "d9bcad4e694df1306def9ea22c9b886a99c477d1d0f1c5e7d213b789253bf88a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:08ca69bd05448d283289298d61fdcc1d1c55c3f91e9bb72e6fd628fb104644f2",
      "request_id": "08ca69bd05448d283289298d61fdcc1d1c55c3f91e9bb72e6fd628fb104644f2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b2c10ce516b19e7428928f9c729c38cf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四月来到林茨，决赛首盘一比六。她用六比四、六比三，把比赛翻了回来。第二座奖杯，仍然是从落后开始。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ce2d24a8186688cafb730a8aa8b7f17806612678f0b80731e5a10d379d6ab5d7",
      "words_sha256": "24bae1b1074548c4c93db71bb7e6cabfd13a8ec819c7584e7e22f87106924f88"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0df449ab6c5f72343a99e512f042a905be2a35ac33da298f686bd79cb0c2bf2a",
      "request_id": "0df449ab6c5f72343a99e512f042a905be2a35ac33da298f686bd79cb0c2bf2a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b4f026d443e0a0e210dfaacf01cd9352",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她是怎么第一次闯进单打年终的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f7900e8320bf5ba2fbd53a85a0561a346220c32dc8e896a26f5ceb53bafee406",
      "words_sha256": "a87b841be62afb77707cd3e8b05c363e5b407353634542f208f5fcf086686dee"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:11ad0429cb7fe002a949641312e1e40d3f7b09745feca3c25aa3fb11fcaadebc",
      "request_id": "11ad0429cb7fe002a949641312e1e40d3f7b09745feca3c25aa3fb11fcaadebc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "476e5837e870bfaf35e7917412ba985c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "新加坡止步八强后，十月九日，官方确认她首次获得单打年终资格。北京那场决赛，还在两天以后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5461165ace384db192d28f65d51ef36d66f93468b1bf99d02a0809680348761f",
      "words_sha256": "9133078bcb7a57a8010173d13b49862f167c9530c4d050fa89bcfcd14ff96839"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1fe603dd519aef3ab4d927fed315a2f3297e7d03b17ce78f05e0c550a5a8fb91",
      "request_id": "1fe603dd519aef3ab4d927fed315a2f3297e7d03b17ce78f05e0c550a5a8fb91",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e1ffe01f6d9a0372ed61e9eae80ec768",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月十二日，她第一次排到世界第三。武汉那一站，则因调整赛程退出。本季至今，五十胜十六负，三次夺冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "278daf26b4a0e71f2dd320f202556c50b922cda8a26077fec7c223a46bd81a63",
      "words_sha256": "eceae0f22159bfd89ec0fd24230a19946b134b46cc63d75e86cedfa7d00a68a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1ffddd15b0dcc4ff52a717df5d0dbf86821bb3c3b892d7a44b49d7328968eb1f",
      "request_id": "1ffddd15b0dcc4ff52a717df5d0dbf86821bb3c3b892d7a44b49d7328968eb1f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "564888d1e15c5374bedcfb6db766e55c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "斯图加特打进四强后，她来到马德里决赛。科斯秋克两盘取胜，这一回，她没能再复制那场逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "49579744ce838c9c41b93b92c196bbc1db6eef870e31382fea45977aef4bf73e",
      "words_sha256": "4097bd375ef7086e5c955d216a01169d531b39555f292b0aafff00ac26663096"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:22ae9d18ed90c8c734a1aa6d48f8b2cf61e6774de79748396a20c9198dc137e1",
      "request_id": "22ae9d18ed90c8c734a1aa6d48f8b2cf61e6774de79748396a20c9198dc137e1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "51aa632597900a6558956cf0f6b7d2a7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "布里斯班止步八强。随后的阿德莱德决赛，她开场零比三落后，随后连赢九局，以六比三、六比一夺冠。先落后的那个人，笑到了最后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f30bb5ec7fe7b0998d89f33c9ff5b678bb2d6e807778761e423214a3bfe28de0",
      "words_sha256": "b395325f0bc3999a0288e714832412dc305058ce19d6ac7818c07785ef38369e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:51d89d103603b1a121e79ea050e58739955b82ae9f35c197869c6b5d5165b5d6",
      "request_id": "51d89d103603b1a121e79ea050e58739955b82ae9f35c197869c6b5d5165b5d6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f5653056fad70d29837b893cd0dab55c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了北京，她再进决赛，却五比七、四比六负于郑钦文。这是她本赛季第五次打进决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9540657fe9eafc8b6701f4406d3ed3a241be464ff92013d2e64d7458222c8206",
      "words_sha256": "b154a032599b1c753952615ba179f56c475afc06f88f87b89a4611894dfe165d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7c95d2403788e7e1dbcd7935e1f68a0a534ee429be4e6f86cedb36a2ae9416cd",
      "request_id": "7c95d2403788e7e1dbcd7935e1f68a0a534ee429be4e6f86cedb36a2ae9416cd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb9da3c0323b9161841c7c9acfe6bfd1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "本季的三座冠军和马德里亚军，构成了她通往年终的重要积累。第一次单打年终，她能把这一年的高光再延续下去吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "518672ba3e1d95a2d29eebff9e9961184b04bbb7532afdc57c4443c6764a6101",
      "words_sha256": "abb97f1aa848c45298412dd3a263334bace23983a40bbe412d3ed1e82f881f20"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8aa9a7ff65456bcc01656aa11e70e0e8baf8ec86973410eb6956a53aacdbb668",
      "request_id": "8aa9a7ff65456bcc01656aa11e70e0e8baf8ec86973410eb6956a53aacdbb668",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a17957650077af79f8e44087b749014a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "多伦多和辛辛那提，都没走到八强。美网，她先赢六比二，第二盘抢七，还有两次直接结束比赛的机会。可最后，高芙完成了逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2b0a0dadf6c49d6ed0ebd59a240bc4bcf3499eaf56d94a42893480cb9f8e46fb",
      "words_sha256": "3baf40cd0d176fa1ffbcd3fa0fa365e2f71beafa0b83a053ba6c417187b302aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7a3a0a50808c47121774d198c34f84ccc9670bff740e06aacde9ed15be30987f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:da80e4bfc034014010abf5096ccd5e0835e7eb9b5cff9f22312de7365f6a8085",
      "request_id": "da80e4bfc034014010abf5096ccd5e0835e7eb9b5cff9f22312de7365f6a8085",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e4f5fc1445c3a67b946867aa8751be01",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "澳网，她停在第四轮。随后多哈到迈阿密的四站硬帝，最好也只到八强。一个冠军，并没能让后面的路变得简单。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e70d31d10f9058edac2bc0601b839d1f35cc71952661a89ed0631985fa6a0ba3",
      "words_sha256": "61f17b375cc83815b6e73d0471514ec0f0b682b6cc953cebfd256f538b2930ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e1596c357e0388e731fbd39f5c6020112594a272b7af5576a16d9a2019621b95",
      "request_id": "e1596c357e0388e731fbd39f5c6020112594a272b7af5576a16d9a2019621b95",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2d3d3774b9808b9f8964eafe9b3845c6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "罗马止步八强，巴黎却打到了最后。她先在半决赛击败科斯秋克，再赢下赫瓦林斯卡。十九岁，第一座大满贯奖杯，终于属于她。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9379101ab9c2f4186f6b22347a339400bc06562afbaafce2be263f3ef571cbef",
      "words_sha256": "215fe9101f5f1eb6eb39d884ca65ac15e33561f1457ebd51c0a415f413f4a00f"
    },
