        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "本季红土二十二胜三负，草地却是一胜两负。温网第二轮，她先赢六比四，后两盘却连着丢掉。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b0be03a2e031e663f7011cbd59eb32b7b6d92e5e9c777d11c0844ea1476cb9cc",
